Provenance: Data collected using a Google Forms survey between 8/28/2026 and 8/31/2026 created by the UVA DS4002 Section 002 course.
Data dictionary:
  Timestamp = The datetime a respondent submitted the survey
  Name = The name of the respondent
  Are you an undergraduate student at UVA? = Binary Yes/No indicating if a participant is a UVA undergrad
  Major = The major of a respondent
  IS A HOTDOG A SANDWICH = Indication of whether the respondent thinks a hot dog is a sandwich
